# What stays out of the image. Rule of thumb: everything .gitignore excludes, plus
# the working stores — a screen atlas does not need gigabytes of raw data.
#
# Note on patterns: this daemon does not honour `**/` reliably, so the heavy paths
# are named explicitly. atlas/geodaten holds 23 GB of raw deliveries next to 17 MB
# of tracked map data — get this wrong and the build context alone is 24 GB.
#
# Careful when trimming: recherche/ is rendered by the site's Werkstatt view, and
# three files under screenshots/ are embedded by "Kleiner Gruß aus der Küche".
# Both are part of what is served, even though they look like storage.

.git
.gitignore
.claude
.ruby-lsp
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.probe
docker-compose.yml

# Working stores
wip/
handarbeit/
skills/
test/

# Local Ruby state. The gems are installed in the build stage into /gems, and
# .vendor/ is fetched there too — copying the host's copies in would shadow both
# and could carry the wrong platform's native extensions.
.bundle/
.vendor/
.env
.env.*

# QA screenshots — except the three a sheet embeds
screenshots/*
!screenshots/vorschau-verkehr.png
!screenshots/vorschau-baer.png
!screenshots/katzundgoldt-crop.png
!screenshots/thumb-*.png

# Raw deliveries and intermediate stages of the geodata pipelines.
# Everything tracked under atlas/geodaten is .js, .geojson, .geojsonl, .rb, .sh or
# .md — the exclusions below take out the rest without touching those.
atlas/geodaten/*.gpkg
atlas/geodaten/*.zip
atlas/geodaten/*.inhalt
atlas/geodaten/*.dat
atlas/geodaten/*.osm.pbf
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/*.gpkg
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/*.zip
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/*.inhalt
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/*.dat
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/*.osm.pbf
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/clc5_2018.utm32s.shape
atlas/geodaten/brandenburg/landnutzung.geojson
atlas/qgis/themen/rumaenien-baer/daten/*.gpkg
ne_10m_*

# Reference scans, templates, personal material — no sheet links any of these
diercke-*.pdf
druck-exempel.pdf
s48_nachscan.pdf
nikolai-*.pdf
nikolai-*.png
*.pptx
uploads/Diplomarbeit.pdf

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
